{"id":"n87937-1-7","stage":4,"title":"허파 · 肺","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87937-1-7-1","ko":"왜 자꾸 담배를 끊으라는 거야?","zh":"为什么一直要我戒烟啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"담배를","meaning":"烟，香烟","explanation":"담배：烟，香烟；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"담배","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63662","senseId":"2","lemma":"담배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끊으라는","meaning":"戒","explanation":"끊다：戒；으라는：引用命令、请求等，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"끊다","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62839","senseId":"4","lemma":"끊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"10c7c905412d5254","term":"담배","zh":"烟，香烟","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3","entryId":"63662","definition":"把晒干的烟叶切成细条用纸卷起，制成点火后供吸入其烟雾的物品。","pronunciation":["담ː배"]},{"id":"c2d51c5ca94e5957","term":"끊다","zh":"戒","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3","entryId":"62839","definition":"不再做习惯性的行为。","pronunciation":["끈타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/e9b141cbbc0749241d94.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87937-1-7-2","ko":"담배가 허파에 얼마나 안 좋은데. 건강을 생각해야지.","zh":"香烟对肺有多不好啊，你总该为健康着想吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"담배가","meaning":"烟，香烟","explanation":"담배：烟，香烟；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"담배","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63662","senseId":"2","lemma":"담배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"허파에","meaning":"肺","explanation":"허파：肺；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"허파","audio":"/audio/3a8cba5ee18dbcfb313d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87937","senseId":"1","lemma":"허파","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多么","explanation":"얼마나：多么","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은데.","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건강을","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각해야지.","meaning":"为……着想，为了","explanation":"생각하다：为……着想，为了；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"생각하다","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66376","senseId":"6","lemma":"생각하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"10c7c905412d5254","term":"담배","zh":"烟，香烟","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3","entryId":"63662","definition":"把晒干的烟叶切成细条用纸卷起，制成点火后供吸入其烟雾的物品。","pronunciation":["담ː배"]},{"id":"3a8cba5ee18dbcfb","term":"허파","zh":"肺","audio":"/audio/3a8cba5ee18dbcfb313d.mp3","entryId":"87937","definition":"位于动物或人胸腔两侧，用来呼吸的器官。","pronunciation":["허파"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"状态或感觉等的程度非常大而厉害地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"b9e697a6a3627e47","term":"건강","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3","entryId":"36670","definition":"指身体或精神没有异常、很结实的状态。","pronunciation":["건ː강"]},{"id":"6ffd015ff4c3322a","term":"생각하다","zh":"为……着想，为了","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3","entryId":"66376","definition":"关心某人或某事，尽心尽力。","pronunciation":["생가카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b2cf84540de70b71370c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.996,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87937","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":143,"sequenceScore":2.8227,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["香烟对肺有多不好啊，你总该为健康着想吧。","承奎，我们要不要去看电影？","为什么一直要我戒烟啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["香烟对肺有多不好啊，你总该为健康着想吧。","为什么一直要我戒烟啊？","承奎，我们要不要去看电影？"],"answer":0}]}
